              "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>095</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>atm</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>64</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>atm</mi></math>",
              "isCorrect": true,
              "image": null
            }
          ],
          "correctValue": null,
          "solution": {
            "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8652;</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>NO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Pressure at equilibrium<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><msub><mi>NO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>28</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>32</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>atm</mi></math></p><p>If volume of the container is doubled, the pressure will reduced to half</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>&#8652;</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math></p><p>New pressure,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>028</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>28</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow></mfenced></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>32</mn></math></p><p>On solving, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>045</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>045</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>095</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>atm</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><msub><mi>NO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>55</mn><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>045</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>64</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>atm</mi></math></p>",
